00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,245
To‘rtta klub.

2
00:00:01,265 --> 00:00:02,502
To‘rtta tarkib.

3
00:00:02,522 --> 00:00:04,741
Hammasi sizning izohlaringizdan.

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,386
Yarim finalgacha bir qadam qoldi.

5
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:09,228
Prime Avangard.

6
00:00:09,248 --> 00:00:11,429
Kapitan — sakkizinchi raqamda.

7
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:16,468
Prime Fc.

8
00:00:16,488 --> 00:00:19,812
Ellik bir raqamini o‘zingiz so‘radingiz — oldingiz.

9
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:23,797
Wakanda team.

10
00:00:23,817 --> 00:00:26,760
Bu tarkib butunlay yangi muxlislardan yig‘ildi.

11
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:31,506
Qayrat Fc.

12
00:00:31,526 --> 00:00:33,631
Oxirgi o‘rin ham egasini topdi.

13
